# Telos, the cantina's games (TSL, 207tel, 211tel, 203tel), a branch from
# Luxa's deal that rejoins nothing: a swoop race on the circuit, Mebla's
# pazaak record and Ramana's freedom ("High Stakes"). The main line
# keeps its credits for Falt; a player with credits to spare plays these
# on the first cantina visit (DSimpson's "Telos: Side Quests", GameBanshee's
# Cantina and Residential 082 East). Starts from Luxa's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @telos_luxa data/routes/tsl/telos_cantina_games.route --god
# BLOCKER: the party's own credits on Telos's first cantina visit do not
# carry Doton Het's 1000-credit wager game after a loss (the main line
# keeps them for Falt, and the loot a player would sell for more is kept
# for later), so a stand-in brings them (SKIPPED.md): enough for a run of
# losses, as the bot plays the opponents' own AI and loses about half.
gold 10000
say I want to race.  # the swoop master: the entry fee talked down
say [Persuade] That's a little steep # ([Persuade] over 6)
say Don't worry, I will
use SwoopMC
talk
race                 # 211tel, back to the cantina's pits at its end: the
say I'll be going now # bot's clean run (some 49 s) takes the third best
talk                 # time; Ov Darum's record (41.27 s) is not reached
say Let's play.      # Mebla: 40 credits a game, three wins for her
say We'll play for credits # record and her Double card; her end script
use Mebla            # starts her conversation again with the result
talk
pazaak
while 202TEL_Mebla=0 # each win counts (a_global_inc), a loss nothing
say Yes, for credits
talk
pazaak
end
while 202TEL_Mebla=1
say Yes, for credits
talk
pazaak
end
while 202TEL_Mebla=2
say Yes, for credits
talk
pazaak
end
talk                 # three: her lucky card given up
until 202TEL_Mebla=4
exit d_Cantina_main  # out to 081 and down to Residential 082 East
module 202tel
exit d_Suburban      # Harra, whose Ramana a Twi'lek won from him at
module 203tel        # pazaak
use door_a1
say What is this predicament
say But you did.
say Of course, you did make her a slave
say Perhaps I could be of assistance
say I'll see what I can do
use harra
talk
until 203TEL_Harra=1
exit Ent081          # back to the cantina: Doton Het, who holds her
module 202tel
exit d_Cantina@3
module 207tel
say I've come on behalf of Harra
say How about you wager her on a game of pazaak
say 1000 credits it is
use doton
talk
say I am taking you back to Harra # his end script starts the talk again
say Let's go         # with the result, at once: won, Ramana handed over
say You're free now, Ramana # and the party taken to 082 East, where her
say Then you can do whatever you wish # meeting with Harra plays: set free,
pazaak               # not made to dance (LSP)
while 203TEL_Ramana=0 # lost: the 1000 taken, and asked again
say I'd like to try again
say 1000 credits it is
talk
pazaak
end
module 203tel
until 203TEL_Ramana=4
